ounters run 2-4% and airports 5-8%, so the best-rate reputation is verified, not merely repeated.@@@_186 @@_109 @@fromUTF8 "|c^C^I|c^C|+|c^C|,|c^C|3|c^B|8|c^C|#|c^C|< |f^V|0|e|.|?|h|%|?|e^O|# |h|%|?|f^V|0|e|.|?7-1-2" @@@_109 @@O fromUTF8 "coords" @@K @@@_192 fromUTF8 "errands/dollar-ranger-shinjuku.md" @@@@fromUTF8 "errand" @@@_186 @@S' O @C C C C C C' _688 fromUTF8 "muji-shinjuku-dori" @@fromUTF8 "MUJI Shinjuku-dori" @@_192 fromUTF8 "|g^D|!|e^M|0|h^I|/|e^S^A |f^V|0|e|.|?|i^@^Z|c^B^J" @@@fromUTF8 $232 Household goods and food MUJI on Shinjuku-dori, B1-3F, 10:00-21:00 daily. Laundry detergent is B1 in 掃除・洗濯用品. Same block as Kinokuniya (3-17-7). This is the 新宿通り branch - NOT Lumine Shinjuku, which opens 11:00.@@_192 fromUTF8 $200 新宿通りの生活雑貨・食品の無印（B1-3F・10:00-21:00）。洗剤はB1の掃除・洗濯用品。紀伊國屋（3-17-7）と同ブロック。ルミネ店（11:00開店）ではない。@@@_192 fromUTF8 "|f^]|1|d|:|,|i^C|=|f^V|0|e|.|?|e^L|:|f^V|0|e|.|?3-17-1 |c^A^D|c^A^U|c^A|?|c^B^D|c^C^S|c^C|+ B1-3F" @@@_192 fromUTF8 "|f^]|1|d|:|,|i^C|=|f^V|0|e|.|?|e^L|:|f^V|0|e|.|?3-17-1" @@@_191 @_191 @_191 @O fromUTF8 "shinjuku" @@K @@O fromUTF8 "shopping" @@O fromUTF8 "errand" @@K @@@fromUTF8 "low" @@fromUTF8 "want" @@_191 @@C C C C' _689 fromUTF8 "Asia/Tokyo" @@@B _192 @S' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "mon" @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "10:00" @@@C _437 @fromUTF8 "21:00" @@@@K @@@S' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "tue" @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "10:00" @@@C _437 @fromUTF8 "21:00" @@@@K @@@S' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "wed" @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "10:00" @@@C _437 @fromUTF8 "21:00" @@@@K @@@S' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "thu" @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "10:00" @@@C _437 @fromUTF8 "21:00" @@@@K @@@S' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "fri" @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "10:00" @@@C _437 @fromUTF8 "21:00" @@@@K @@@S' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "sat" @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "10:00" @@@C _437 @fromUTF8 "21:00" @@@@K @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "sun" @@@C' O @S' P @C _437 @fromUTF8 "10:00" @@@C _437 @fromUTF8 "21:00" @@@@K @@@K @@@@@@@@@_